.SH "نام (NAME)"
pano_trafo \- Transform image coordinates.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBpano_trafo\fR [options] \fIpano.pto\fR \fIimage_number\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBpano_trafo\fR reads image coordiates (x y) from standard input and
prints the corresponding panorama coordinates to standard output.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \fB\-r\fR 4
.IX Item "-r"
Reverse transformation, read panorama coordinates and print image
coordinates.
